# Infinite Queue Consumer (v7)

Works with `product-completion-directive.mdc`. **Completion standard governs quality; queue governs sequence.**

## Execute

1. Read `docs/QUEUE_STATE.md` → `current_task`
2. Read phase scope in `docs/PRODUCT_COMPLETION_DIRECTIVE.md`
3. Implement until **all completion layers** pass
4. Update QUEUE_STATE → start next Task **without pause**

Queue T300 done → R2 T301 auto. Queue empty → **generate next queue**.

## Hierarchy

Release → Product → Mission → Epic → Sprint → Feature → Task → Sub-task

## Forbidden

다음 작업은… · 승인 · 배포할까요 · Release/Epic/Sprint 완료 보고

## Stop (5)

Build fail · Prod outage · DB/LLM/Billing/Auth cost · Security · CPO vision change

